   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Train timetables and public transport",
     "texto": [
      "At Portuguese train stations (CP - Comboios de Portugal), platforms are called **plataformas** or **linhas**.",
      "To say when a train departs, use the verb **sair**: **sai às nove e vinte** (it leaves at 9:20).",
      "Duration is expressed with **demorar**: **A viagem demora uma hora** (the trip takes one hour).",
      "Before boarding the train, it's a good idea to **consultar o painel** (check the departures board)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
